            "review_title": "Review at Cheers Bagel",
            "review_text": "Dy L\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nA Hidden Gem for Bagel Lovers\nJul 2025 • Friends\nWe stumbled upon Cheers Bagel and instantly fell in love! The bagels are perfectly chewy on the inside, crisp on the outside, and packed with flavor. You can really taste the care that goes into every bite. The staff were super friendly and welcoming — they made us feel right at home.\n\nI had the Special K'Chick bagel, and it was hands down one of the best bagels I’ve ever had. Great apple mint tea, great vibes, and a cozy atmosphere to top it off.\n\nIf you're a bagel lover or just someone who appreciates quality food and warm service, this place is a gem. We'll definitely be back!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 12, 2025",
